{"unit_id":"Choi-Peng__dsh-footer-order#feature-1","repo":"Choi-Peng/dsh-footer-order","commit":"69867ed91b45459f56df08d78c499b45d8ac0616","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Footer Order 的功能：竖向堆叠页脚动作：插件为 sidebar.footer.action 槽位应用布局样式，可设置 column、row 或不干预，并配置间距和对齐方式。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:288-366"]}
{"unit_id":"Choi-Peng__dsh-footer-order#feature-2","repo":"Choi-Peng/dsh-footer-order","commit":"69867ed91b45459f56df08d78c499b45d8ac0616","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Footer Order 的功能：配置页脚条目顺序：配置页提供上下移动操作；客户端根据已注册条目和当前渲染节点匹配身份，再按指定次序调整显示。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:634-813"]}
{"unit_id":"Choi-Peng__dsh-footer-order#feature-3","repo":"Choi-Peng/dsh-footer-order","commit":"69867ed91b45459f56df08d78c499b45d8ac0616","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Footer Order 的功能：将设置行加入页脚排序：在排序列表中使用保留键 settings，可把外壳设置行放到页脚条目之前、之间或之后。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:821-861"]}
{"unit_id":"Choi-Peng__dsh-footer-order#feature-4","repo":"Choi-Peng/dsh-footer-order","commit":"69867ed91b45459f56df08d78c499b45d8ac0616","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Footer Order 的功能：排列整个设置区：设置区可配置布局、间距、对齐和区块顺序；区块顺序通过 CSS order 应用，设置表单提供保存和恢复默认操作。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:496-628"]}
